  "details": "   * Backport upstream's fixes from OpenJDK 11.0.23 release.\n     - CVE-2024-21011: possible crash on long exception message in Hotspot.\n     - CVE-2024-21012: incorrect performing a reverse DNS query\n       in ConnectionPool class.\n     - CVE-2024-21068: incorrect applying an unsigned integer left shift\n       in Hotspot.\n     - CVE-2024-21085: incorrect memory size validation by the NativeUnpack class.\n     - CVE-2024-21094: possible C2 compilation error due to incorrect size\n       validation and out of bounds array access in Hotspot.",
